	(text "1. Place 0.1uF capacitors from SRP to GND and SRN to GND to suppress transients\n2. Noise on FETOFF and SHUT causing random AFE reset during SCD test. \n3. Connect 0 ohm to R25,R22,C25,C28 to directly ground FETOFF and SHUT pins to avoid noise.\n4. R103,R104,R105,R115,R117 were heating during reverse polarity \n5. Place 10nF capacitors in parallel to D3,D49 and C17"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 60.8076 284.099 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 3 3)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
